'''Pabu''' was a small [[planet]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|pabu|Pabu}}</ref> dotted with small islands,<ref name="2024 Encyclopedia" /> including a [[Pabu island|remote island]] that was a haven for [[refugee]]s displaced during the [[Clone Wars]] and others after.<ref name="Pabu" /> During or after [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|213}}</ref> [[Clone Force 99]] traveled to the location to reach Pabu, which was recommended by [[Phee Genoa]] as a place where [[Ciddarin Scaleback|Cid]] could not find them and where they could settle down with [[Omega]]. Genoa described the location as her "home away from home."<ref name="Pabu" /> It had no spaceports or major industries, and most of the residents were refugees seeking safety from other worlds.<ref name="2024 Encyclopedia" /> Clone Force 99 took a liking to the planet, and decided it would be a good place to settle down.<ref name="Plan 99">{{TBB|Plan 99 (episode)}}</ref> 

After rescuing the [[clone cadet]]s [[Deke]], [[Stak (cadet)|Stak]], and [[Mox]] from the planet [[Setron]], [[Hunter]] decided to drop the cadets off on Pabu.<ref name="Paths Unknown">{{TBB|Paths Unknown}}</ref> When the Bad Batch finally were reunited with Omega and [[Crosshair]], they returned to Pabu.<ref name="The Return">{{TBB|The Return}}</ref>

